# Time-boxed exceptions to the image scan. Each entry needs a reason and an expiry: after
# the exp: date the finding fails CI again, so it gets looked at instead of forgotten.

# golang.org/x/net/html denial of service, inside the PocketBase binary (/app/pocketbase).
# PocketBase v0.40.6 (latest, 2026-10-23) is still built with x/net 0.61.0; fixed in 0.62.0.
# Remove this once PB_VERSION is bumped to a release built with x/net >= 0.62.0.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2026-12-09
